OL,3,GNEWSABaby girl found at house was
OL,4,Astabbed, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA newborn baby girl who was discovered
OL,7,Ffatally injured at a house in Sheffield
OL,8,Fdied as a result of stab wounds, police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FThe baby was found at a house on
OL,12,FHolywell Heights in the Wincobank area
OL,13,Fon Sunday morning, after police were
OL,14,Fcalled to reports of concern for her
OL,15,Fsafety.
OL,17,FSouth Yorkshire Police said despite the
OL,18,Fbest efforts of police and paramedics,
OL,19,Fthe baby died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
