OL,3,GNEWSABaby girl found at house was
OL,4,Astabbed, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people aged between 15 and 37
OL,7,Fwere arrested on suspicion of her
OL,8,Fmurder. Two of them, aged 26 and 37,
OL,9,Fwere later bailed, but police confirmed
OL,10,Fon Tuesday a warrant had been obtained
OL,11,Fto extend time in custody for the
OL,12,Fremaining five as inquiries continued.
